<title>GERMANY: Continental 96 net profit rises 24 pct.</title>
<headline>Continental 96 net profit rises 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   192.5   vs 155.2</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     524.1   vs 387.6</p>
<p>    Group sales				  10,400  up 1.7 pct</p>
<p>    Dividend				     0.60    vs 0.50 dmk</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German tyre manufacturer is Continental AG.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
